   "source": [
    "<a name=\"setup\"></a>\n",
    "## 1. Setup & Environment\n",
    "Configure runtime, plotting styles, and path resolution for Word phishing detection.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<a name=\"import_libraries\"></a>\n",
    "### 1.1 Import Libraries\n",
    "Import analytical and visualization libraries.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-03T09:53:08.556650Z",
